{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>YouYu 是一款輕量的個人理財記帳工具，適合想掌握日常開支、帳戶結餘與定期帳單的用家，透過簡單操作整理收入、支出與轉帳紀錄，並查看月度收支總結。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可在 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-160.webp\">\n<h2>收支記錄與帳單提醒</h2>\n<p>YouYu 讓你記錄現金、銀行卡、信用卡、儲蓄戶口及自訂帳戶的收入、支出與轉帳，並按分類整理交易，透過月度總結與圖表瞭解資金流向。面對租金、訂閱、貸款等定期支出，App 會在帳單到期時提醒你，標記為已付款後更自動建立對應支出紀錄。另支援本機備份還原、可選 Google Drive 同步，以及密碼與 Face ID 解鎖。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-174-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-175-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-176-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-177-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-178-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-179-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：YouYu</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.243209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:18:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:04.534234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:00.902715+00:00","content_hash":"7e452977b667774e9388b9158223585c42bcd968245a485d8c4b2bbcacfe4361","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}